    "issue_alignment": "Matches the public issue: heap-buffer-overflow (8-byte read of _data.size) in h2o's HTTP/2 scheduler when a stream is closed while its scheduler reference is still live. preserve_stream_scheduler moves the active ref into a truncated closed-stream stub without deactivating it; the subsequent h2o_http2_scheduler_run pops the stub and emit_writereq_of_openref reads stream->_data.size beyond the stub allocation."
